        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Peter Duffell, Ken Hughes, James Mason, Robert Culp, Telly Savalas\n- Works: Inside Out, Chitty Chitty Bang Bang\n- Roles: film director, television director, screenwriter, writer, producer\n- Places: Canterbury, England\n\nFacts:\n- Ken Hughes was born on 19 January 1922 and died on 28 April 2001.\n- Peter Duffell was born in 1937 in Canterbury, England.\n- Ken Hughes was a British film director, writer, and producer.\n- Peter Duffell is a British film and television director and screenwriter.\n- Ken Hughes is best known as the co-writer and director of the 1968 children's film Chitty Chitty Bang Bang.\n- Inside Out is a 1975 British action thriller film.\n- Peter Duffell produced and directed the 1975 film Inside Out.\n- James Mason, Robert Culp, and Telly Savalas starred in Inside Out.",
